# models/ – pre-trained model weights
#
# This directory is intentionally kept empty in source control.
# Download or mount model weights before starting the service.
#
# Expected structure:
#   models/
#     yolo/
#       ramp.pt         # YOLOv8 ramp detector weights
#       step.pt         # YOLOv8 step/staircase detector weights
#       elevator.pt     # YOLOv8 elevator detector weights
#       door.pt         # YOLOv8 door detector weights
#       signage.pt      # YOLOv8 accessibility-signage detector weights
#       tactile.pt      # YOLOv8 tactile-paving detector weights
#     phobert/
#       config.json
#       pytorch_model.bin  (or model.safetensors)
#       tokenizer_config.json
#       vocab.txt
#       special_tokens_map.json
#
# In Docker/Kubernetes mount this directory as a volume:
#   docker run -v /host/models:/service/models accessmap-ai
#
# ── What to ignore ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.pt
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.pth
*.h5
*.pb
